  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧紡織品",
    "sub_ename": "SMART TEXTILES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要講授紡織品受到溫度、光、壓力、電磁場等外界環境與身體生理的變化時，通過紡織品功能和感測器，以感應、檢測、與判斷外界環境與身體生理的變化，並以電子資訊技術運算傳輸，從而做出相因應的反應。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the changes of external environment such as temperature, light, pressure, electric field, magnetic field, and the changes of physical physiology, through the textile function and sensor to senses, detection, and judge the external environment and physical physiology changes; and using the electronic information technology to transmission and make the response.",
